{"1":{"w":[{"c":"صٓ","d":"sad","e":"Saad"},{"c":"وَالْقُرْءَانِ","d":"wal-qur'āni","e":"By the Quran"},{"c":"ذِي","d":"dhī","e":"full (of) reminder"},{"c":"الذِّكْرِ","d":"l-dhik'ri","e":"full (of) reminder"}],"a":{"g":"Sad. By the Qur'an containing reminder..."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"بَلِ","d":"bali","e":"Nay"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"عِزَّةٍ","d":"ʿizzatin","e":"self-glory"},{"c":"وَشِقَاقٍ","d":"washiqāqin","e":"and opposition"}],"a":{"g":"But those who disbelieve are in pride and dissension."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"كَمْ","d":"kam","e":"How many"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْنَا","d":"ahlaknā","e":"We destroyed"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"before them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"قَرْنٍ","d":"qarnin","e":"a generation"},{"c":"فَنَادَوْا","d":"fanādaw","e":"then they called out"},{"c":"وَلَاتَ","d":"walāta","e":"when there (was) no longer"},{"c":"حِينَ","d":"ḥīna","e":"time"},{"c":"مَنَاصٍ","d":"manāṣin","e":"(for) escape"}],"a":{"g":"How many a generation have We destroyed before them, and they [then] called out; but it was not a time for escape."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَعَجِبُوا","d":"waʿajibū","e":"And they wonder"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"has come to them"},{"c":"مُنْذِرٌ","d":"mundhirun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from among themselves"},{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"And said"},{"c":"الْكَافِرُونَ","d":"l-kāfirūna","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"سَاحِرٌ","d":"sāḥirun","e":"(is) a magician"},{"c":"كَذَّابٌ","d":"kadhābun","e":"a liar"}],"a":{"g":"And they wonder that there has come to them a warner from among themselves. And the disbelievers say, \"This is a magician and a liar."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"أَجَعَلَ","d":"ajaʿala","e":"Has he made"},{"c":"الْءَالِهَةَ","d":"l-ālihata","e":"the gods"},{"c":"إِلَهًا","d":"ilāhan","e":"(into) one god"},{"c":"وَاحِدًا","d":"wāḥidan","e":"(into) one god"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"لَشَيْءٌ","d":"lashayon","e":"(is) certainly a thing"},{"c":"عُجَابٌ","d":"ʿujābun","e":"curious"}],"a":{"g":"Has he made the gods [only] one God? Indeed, this is a curious thing.\""}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَانْطَلَقَ","d":"wa-inṭalaqa","e":"And went forth"},{"c":"الْمَلَأُ","d":"l-mala-u","e":"the chiefs"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"among them"},{"c":"أَنِ","d":"ani","e":"that"},{"c":"امْشُوا","d":"im'shū","e":"Continue"},{"c":"وَاصْبِرُوا","d":"wa-iṣ'birū","e":"and be patient"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"ءَالِهَتِكُمْ","d":"ālihatikum","e":"your gods"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"لَشَيْءٌ","d":"lashayon","e":"(is) certainly a thing"},{"c":"يُرَادُ","d":"yurādu","e":"intended"}],"a":{"g":"And the eminent among them went forth, [saying], \"Continue, and be patient over [the defense of] your gods. Indeed, this is a thing intended."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"سَمِعْنَا","d":"samiʿ'nā","e":"we heard"},{"c":"بِهَذَا","d":"bihādhā","e":"of this"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْمِلَّةِ","d":"l-milati","e":"the religion"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"the last"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"(is) this"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"اخْتِلَاقٌ","d":"ikh'tilāqun","e":"a fabrication"}],"a":{"g":"We have not heard of this in the latest religion. This is not but a fabrication."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"أَءُنزِلَ","d":"a-unzila","e":"Has been revealed"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"الذِّكْرُ","d":"l-dhik'ru","e":"the Message"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"بَيْنِنَا","d":"bayninā","e":"among us"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"شَكٍّ","d":"shakkin","e":"doubt"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"about"},{"c":"ذِكْرِي","d":"dhik'rī","e":"My Message"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَذُوقُوا","d":"yadhūqū","e":"they have tasted"},{"c":"عَذَابِ","d":"ʿadhābi","e":"My punishment"}],"a":{"g":"Has the message been revealed to him out of [all of] us?\" Rather, they are in doubt about My message. Rather, they have not yet tasted My punishment."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"عِنْدَهُمْ","d":"ʿindahum","e":"have they"},{"c":"خَزَائِنُ","d":"khazāinu","e":"(the) treasures"},{"c":"رَحْمَةِ","d":"raḥmati","e":"(of the) Mercy"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزِ","d":"l-ʿazīzi","e":"the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْوَهَّابِ","d":"l-wahābi","e":"the Bestower"}],"a":{"g":"Or do they have the depositories of the mercy of your Lord, the Exalted in Might, the Bestower?"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مُلْكُ","d":"mul'ku","e":"(is the) dominion"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between them"},{"c":"فَلْيَرْتَقُوا","d":"falyartaqū","e":"Then let them ascend"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"by"},{"c":"الْأَسْبَابِ","d":"l-asbābi","e":"the means"}],"a":{"g":"Or is theirs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and what is between them? Then let them ascend through [any] ways of access."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"جُنْدٌ","d":"jundun","e":"Soldiers"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"there"},{"c":"هُنَالِكَ","d":"hunālika","e":"there"},{"c":"مَهْزُومٌ","d":"mahzūmun","e":"(they will be) defeated"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"among"},{"c":"الْأَحْزَابِ","d":"l-aḥzābi","e":"the companies"}],"a":{"g":"[They are but] soldiers [who will be] defeated there among the companies [of disbelievers]."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُمْ","d":"qablahum","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَوْمُ","d":"qawmu","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"نُوحٍ","d":"nūḥin","e":"(of) Nuh"},{"c":"وَعَادٌ","d":"waʿādun","e":"and Aad"},{"c":"وَفِرْعَوْنُ","d":"wafir'ʿawnu","e":"and Firaun"},{"c":"ذُو","d":"dhū","e":"(the) owner"},{"c":"الْأَوْتَادِ","d":"l-awtādi","e":"(of) the stakes"}],"a":{"g":"The people of Noah denied before them, and [the tribe of] 'Aad and Pharaoh, the owner of stakes,"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَثَمُودُ","d":"wathamūdu","e":"And Thamud"},{"c":"وَقَوْمُ","d":"waqawmu","e":"and (the) people"},{"c":"لُوطٍ","d":"lūṭin","e":"(of) Lut"},{"c":"وَأَصْحَابُ","d":"wa-aṣḥābu","e":"and (the) companions"},{"c":"لْءَيْكَةِ","d":"al'aykati","e":"(of) the wood"},{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"Those"},{"c":"الْأَحْزَابُ","d":"l-aḥzābu","e":"(were) the companies"}],"a":{"g":"And [the tribe of] Thamud and the people of Lot and the companions of the thicket. Those are the companies."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"كُلٌّ","d":"kullun","e":"all (of them)"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"كَذَّبَ","d":"kadhaba","e":"denied"},{"c":"الرُّسُلَ","d":"l-rusula","e":"the Messengers"},{"c":"فَحَقَّ","d":"faḥaqqa","e":"so was just"},{"c":"عِقَابِ","d":"ʿiqābi","e":"My penalty"}],"a":{"g":"Each of them denied the messengers, so My penalty was justified."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُ","d":"yanẓuru","e":"await"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"these"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"صَيْحَةً","d":"ṣayḥatan","e":"a shout"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةً","d":"wāḥidatan","e":"one"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"for it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"فَوَاقٍ","d":"fawāqin","e":"delay"}],"a":{"g":"And these [disbelievers] await not but one blast [of the Horn]; for it there will be no delay."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they say"},{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"Our Lord!"},{"c":"عَجِّلْ","d":"ʿajjil","e":"Hasten"},{"c":"لَنَا","d":"lanā","e":"for us"},{"c":"قِطَّنَا","d":"qiṭṭanā","e":"our share"},{"c":"قَبْلَ","d":"qabla","e":"before"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الْحِسَابِ","d":"l-ḥisābi","e":"(of) the Account"}],"a":{"g":"And they say, \"Our Lord, hasten for us our share [of the punishment] before the Day of Account\""}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"اصْبِرْ","d":"iṣ'bir","e":"Be patient"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"they say"},{"c":"وَاذْكُرْ","d":"wa-udh'kur","e":"and remember"},{"c":"عَبْدَنَا","d":"ʿabdanā","e":"Our slave"},{"c":"دَاوُدَ","d":"dāwūda","e":"Dawood"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"the possessor of strength"},{"c":"الْأَيْدِ","d":"l-aydi","e":"the possessor of strength"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, he (was)"},{"c":"أَوَّابٌ","d":"awwābun","e":"repeatedly turning"}],"a":{"g":"Be patient over what they say and remember Our servant, David, the possessor of strength; indeed, he was one who repeatedly turned back [to Allah]."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"سَخَّرْنَا","d":"sakharnā","e":"subjected"},{"c":"الْجِبَالَ","d":"l-jibāla","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"مَعَهُ","d":"maʿahu","e":"with him"},{"c":"يُسَبِّحْنَ","d":"yusabbiḥ'na","e":"glorifying"},{"c":"بِالْعَشِيِّ","d":"bil-ʿashiyi","e":"in the evening"},{"c":"وَالْإِشْرَاقِ","d":"wal-ish'rāqi","e":"and [the] sunrise"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We subjected the mountains [to praise] with him, exalting [Allah] in the [late] afternoon and [after] sunrise."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَالطَّيْرَ","d":"wal-ṭayra","e":"And the birds"},{"c":"مَحْشُورَةً","d":"maḥshūratan","e":"assembled"},{"c":"كُلٌّ","d":"kullun","e":"all"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"with him"},{"c":"أَوَّابٌ","d":"awwābun","e":"repeatedly turning"}],"a":{"g":"And the birds were assembled, all with him repeating [praises]."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَشَدَدْنَا","d":"washadadnā","e":"And We strengthened"},{"c":"مُلْكَهُ","d":"mul'kahu","e":"his kingdom"},{"c":"وَءَاتَيْنَاهُ","d":"waātaynāhu","e":"and We gave him"},{"c":"الْحِكْمَةَ","d":"l-ḥik'mata","e":"[the] wisdom"},{"c":"وَفَصْلَ","d":"wafaṣla","e":"and decisive"},{"c":"الْخِطَابِ","d":"l-khiṭābi","e":"speech"}],"a":{"g":"And We strengthened his kingdom and gave him wisdom and discernment in speech."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَهَلْ","d":"wahal","e":"And has (there)"},{"c":"أَتَىكَ","d":"atāka","e":"come to you"},{"c":"نَبَؤُا","d":"naba-u","e":"(the) news"},{"c":"الْخَصْمِ","d":"l-khaṣmi","e":"(of) the litigants"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"تَسَوَّرُوا","d":"tasawwarū","e":"they climbed over the wall"},{"c":"الْمِحْرَابَ","d":"l-miḥ'rāba","e":"(of) the chamber"}],"a":{"g":"And has there come to you the news of the adversaries, when they climbed over the wall of [his] prayer chamber -"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"دَخَلُوا","d":"dakhalū","e":"they entered"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"دَاوُدَ","d":"dāwūda","e":"Dawood"},{"c":"فَفَزِعَ","d":"fafaziʿa","e":"and he was afraid"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"of them"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"they said"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَخَفْ","d":"takhaf","e":"fear"},{"c":"خَصْمَانِ","d":"khaṣmāni","e":"(We are) two litigants"},{"c":"بَغَى","d":"baghā","e":"has wronged"},{"c":"بَعْضُنَا","d":"baʿḍunā","e":"one of us"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"بَعْضٍ","d":"baʿḍin","e":"another"},{"c":"فَاحْكُمْ","d":"fa-uḥ'kum","e":"so judge"},{"c":"بَيْنَنَا","d":"baynanā","e":"between us"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تُشْطِطْ","d":"tush'ṭiṭ","e":"be unjust"},{"c":"وَاهْدِنَا","d":"wa-ih'dinā","e":"and guide us"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"سَوَاءِ","d":"sawāi","e":"an even"},{"c":"الصِّرَاطِ","d":"l-ṣirāṭi","e":"[the] path"}],"a":{"g":"When they entered upon David and he was alarmed by them? They said, \"Fear not. [We are] two adversaries, one of whom has wronged the other, so judge between us with truth and do not exceed [it] and guide us to the sound path."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"أَخِي","d":"akhī","e":"(is) my brother"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"he has"},{"c":"تِسْعٌ","d":"tis'ʿun","e":"ninety-nine"},{"c":"وَتِسْعُونَ","d":"watis'ʿūna","e":"ninety-nine"},{"c":"نَعْجَةً","d":"naʿjatan","e":"ewe(s)"},{"c":"وَلِيَ","d":"waliya","e":"while I have"},{"c":"نَعْجَةٌ","d":"naʿjatun","e":"ewe"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةٌ","d":"wāḥidatun","e":"one"},{"c":"فَقَالَ","d":"faqāla","e":"so he said"},{"c":"أَكْفِلْنِيهَا","d":"akfil'nīhā","e":"Entrust her to me"},{"c":"وَعَزَّنِي","d":"waʿazzanī","e":"and he overpowered me"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْخِطَابِ","d":"l-khiṭābi","e":"[the] speech"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed this, my brother, has ninety-nine ewes, and I have one ewe; so he said, 'Entrust her to me,' and he overpowered me in speech.\""}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"لَقَدْ","d":"laqad","e":"Certainly"},{"c":"ظَلَمَكَ","d":"ẓalamaka","e":"he has wronged you"},{"c":"بِسُؤَالِ","d":"bisuāli","e":"by demanding"},{"c":"نَعْجَتِكَ","d":"naʿjatika","e":"your ewe"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"نِعَاجِهِ","d":"niʿājihi","e":"his ewes"},{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"كَثِيرًا","d":"kathīran","e":"many"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْخُلَطَاءِ","d":"l-khulaṭāi","e":"the partners"},{"c":"لَيَبْغِي","d":"layabghī","e":"certainly oppress"},{"c":"بَعْضُهُمْ","d":"baʿḍuhum","e":"one"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"[on]"},{"c":"بَعْضٍ","d":"baʿḍin","e":"another"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"وَقَلِيلٌ","d":"waqalīlun","e":"and few"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(are) they"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"(are) they"},{"c":"وَظَنَّ","d":"waẓanna","e":"And became certain"},{"c":"دَاوُدُ","d":"dāwūdu","e":"Dawood"},{"c":"أَنَّمَا","d":"annamā","e":"that"},{"c":"فَتَنَّاهُ","d":"fatannāhu","e":"We (had) tried him"},{"c":"فَاسْتَغْفَرَ","d":"fa-is'taghfara","e":"and he asked forgiveness"},{"c":"رَبَّهُ","d":"rabbahu","e":"(of) his Lord"},{"c":"وَخَرَّ","d":"wakharra","e":"and fell down"},{"c":"رَاكِعًا","d":"rākiʿan","e":"bowing"},{"c":"وَأَنَابَ","d":"wa-anāba","e":"and turned in repentance"}],"a":{"g":"[David] said, \"He has certainly wronged you in demanding your ewe [in addition] to his ewes. And indeed, many associates oppress one another, except for those who believe and do righteous deeds - and few are they.\" And David became certain that We had tried him, and he asked forgiveness of his Lord and fell down bowing [in prostration] and turned in repentance [to Allah]."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"فَغَفَرْنَا","d":"faghafarnā","e":"So We forgave"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"عِنْدَنَا","d":"ʿindanā","e":"with Us"},{"c":"لَزُلْفَى","d":"lazul'fā","e":"surely is a near access"},{"c":"وَحُسْنَ","d":"waḥus'na","e":"and a good"},{"c":"مَءَابٍ","d":"maābin","e":"place of return"}],"a":{"g":"So We forgave him that; and indeed, for him is nearness to Us and a good place of return."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"يَادَاوُدُ","d":"yādāwūdu","e":"O Dawood!"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"جَعَلْنَاكَ","d":"jaʿalnāka","e":"[We] have made you"},{"c":"خَلِيفَةً","d":"khalīfatan","e":"a vicegerent"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"فَاحْكُمْ","d":"fa-uḥ'kum","e":"so judge"},{"c":"بَيْنَ","d":"bayna","e":"between"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"[the] men"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَتَّبِعِ","d":"tattabiʿi","e":"follow"},{"c":"الْهَوَى","d":"l-hawā","e":"the desire"},{"c":"فَيُضِلَّكَ","d":"fayuḍillaka","e":"for it will lead you stray"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"سَبِيلِ","d":"sabīli","e":"(the) way"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"يَضِلُّونَ","d":"yaḍillūna","e":"go astray"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"سَبِيلِ","d":"sabīli","e":"(the) way"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"(is) a punishment"},{"c":"شَدِيدٌ","d":"shadīdun","e":"severe"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"because"},{"c":"نَسُوا","d":"nasū","e":"they forgot"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الْحِسَابِ","d":"l-ḥisābi","e":"(of) Account"}],"a":{"g":"[We said], \"O David, indeed We have made you a successor upon the earth, so judge between the people in truth and do not follow [your own] desire, as it will lead you astray from the way of Allah.\" Indeed, those who go astray from the way of Allah will have a severe punishment for having forgotten the Day of Account."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"السَّمَاءَ","d":"l-samāa","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between them"},{"c":"بَاطِلًا","d":"bāṭilan","e":"without purpose"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"ظَنُّ","d":"ẓannu","e":"(is the) assumption"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"فَوَيْلٌ","d":"fawaylun","e":"So woe"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"to those"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"who disbelieve"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"the Fire"}],"a":{"g":"And We did not create the heaven and the earth and that between them aimlessly. That is the assumption of those who disbelieve, so woe to those who disbelieve from the Fire."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"نَجْعَلُ","d":"najʿalu","e":"should We treat"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"كَالْمُفْسِدِينَ","d":"kal-muf'sidīna","e":"like those who spread corruption"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"نَجْعَلُ","d":"najʿalu","e":"should We treat"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the pious"},{"c":"كَالْفُجَّارِ","d":"kal-fujāri","e":"like the wicked"}],"a":{"g":"Or should we treat those who believe and do righteous deeds like corrupters in the land? Or should We treat those who fear Allah like the wicked?"}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"(This is) a Book"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَاهُ","d":"anzalnāhu","e":"We have revealed it"},{"c":"إِلَيْكَ","d":"ilayka","e":"to you"},{"c":"مُبَارَكٌ","d":"mubārakun","e":"blessed"},{"c":"لِيَدَّبَّرُوا","d":"liyaddabbarū","e":"that they may ponder"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"(over) its Verses"},{"c":"وَلِيَتَذَكَّرَ","d":"waliyatadhakkara","e":"and may be reminded"},{"c":"أُولُوا","d":"ulū","e":"those of understanding"},{"c":"الْأَلْبَابِ","d":"l-albābi","e":"those of understanding"}],"a":{"g":"[This is] a blessed Book which We have revealed to you, [O Muhammad], that they might reflect upon its verses and that those of understanding would be reminded."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَوَهَبْنَا","d":"wawahabnā","e":"And We gave"},{"c":"لِدَاوُدَ","d":"lidāwūda","e":"to Dawood"},{"c":"سُلَيْمَانَ","d":"sulaymāna","e":"Sulaiman"},{"c":"نِعْمَ","d":"niʿ'ma","e":"an excellent"},{"c":"الْعَبْدُ","d":"l-ʿabdu","e":"slave"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed he"},{"c":"أَوَّابٌ","d":"awwābun","e":"was one who repeatedly turned"}],"a":{"g":"And to David We gave Solomon. An excellent servant, indeed he was one repeatedly turning back [to Allah]."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"عُرِضَ","d":"ʿuriḍa","e":"were displayed"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"بِالْعَشِيِّ","d":"bil-ʿashiyi","e":"in the afternoon"},{"c":"الصَّافِنَاتُ","d":"l-ṣāfinātu","e":"excellent bred steeds"},{"c":"الْجِيَادُ","d":"l-jiyādu","e":"excellent bred steeds"}],"a":{"g":"[Mention] when there were exhibited before him in the afternoon the poised [standing] racehorses."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَالَ","d":"faqāla","e":"And he said"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"أَحْبَبْتُ","d":"aḥbabtu","e":"[I] preferred"},{"c":"حُبَّ","d":"ḥubba","e":"(the) love"},{"c":"الْخَيْرِ","d":"l-khayri","e":"(of) the good"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"for"},{"c":"ذِكْرِ","d":"dhik'ri","e":"(the) remembrance"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"(of) my Lord"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"Until"},{"c":"تَوَارَتْ","d":"tawārat","e":"they were hidden"},{"c":"بِالْحِجَابِ","d":"bil-ḥijābi","e":"in the veil"}],"a":{"g":"And he said, \"Indeed, I gave preference to the love of good [things] over the remembrance of my Lord until the sun disappeared into the curtain [of darkness].\""}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"رُدُّوهَا","d":"ruddūhā","e":"Return them"},{"c":"عَلَيَّ","d":"ʿalayya","e":"to me"},{"c":"فَطَفِقَ","d":"faṭafiqa","e":"Then he began"},{"c":"مَسْحًا","d":"masḥan","e":"to pass (his hand)"},{"c":"بِالسُّوقِ","d":"bil-sūqi","e":"over the legs"},{"c":"وَالْأَعْنَاقِ","d":"wal-aʿnāqi","e":"and the necks"}],"a":{"g":"[He said], \"Return them to me,\" and set about striking [their] legs and necks."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"فَتَنَّا","d":"fatannā","e":"We tried"},{"c":"سُلَيْمَانَ","d":"sulaymāna","e":"Sulaiman"},{"c":"وَأَلْقَيْنَا","d":"wa-alqaynā","e":"and We placed"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"كُرْسِيِّهِ","d":"kur'siyyihi","e":"his throne"},{"c":"جَسَدًا","d":"jasadan","e":"a body"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"أَنَابَ","d":"anāba","e":"he turned"}],"a":{"g":"And We certainly tried Solomon and placed on his throne a body; then he returned."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"O my Lord"},{"c":"اغْفِرْ","d":"igh'fir","e":"Forgive"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"me"},{"c":"وَهَبْ","d":"wahab","e":"and grant"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"me"},{"c":"مُلْكًا","d":"mul'kan","e":"a kingdom"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَنْبَغِي","d":"yanbaghī","e":"(will) belong"},{"c":"لِأَحَدٍ","d":"li-aḥadin","e":"to anyone"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after me"},{"c":"بَعْدِي","d":"baʿdī","e":"after me"},{"c":"إِنَّكَ","d":"innaka","e":"Indeed, You"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"[You]"},{"c":"الْوَهَّابُ","d":"l-wahābu","e":"(are) the Bestower"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"My Lord, forgive me and grant me a kingdom such as will not belong to anyone after me. Indeed, You are the Bestower.\""}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَخَّرْنَا","d":"fasakharnā","e":"Then We subjected"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to him"},{"c":"الرِّيحَ","d":"l-rīḥa","e":"the wind"},{"c":"تَجْرِي","d":"tajrī","e":"to flow"},{"c":"بِأَمْرِهِ","d":"bi-amrihi","e":"by his command"},{"c":"رُخَاءً","d":"rukhāan","e":"gently"},{"c":"حَيْثُ","d":"ḥaythu","e":"wherever"},{"c":"أَصَابَ","d":"aṣāba","e":"he directed"}],"a":{"g":"So We subjected to him the wind blowing by his command, gently, wherever he directed,"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَالشَّيَاطِينَ","d":"wal-shayāṭīna","e":"And the devils"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"every"},{"c":"بَنَّاءٍ","d":"bannāin","e":"builder"},{"c":"وَغَوَّاصٍ","d":"waghawwāṣin","e":"and diver"}],"a":{"g":"And [also] the devils [of jinn] - every builder and diver"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَاخَرِينَ","d":"waākharīna","e":"And others"},{"c":"مُقَرَّنِينَ","d":"muqarranīna","e":"bound"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَصْفَادِ","d":"l-aṣfādi","e":"chains"}],"a":{"g":"And others bound together in shackles."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"عَطَاؤُنَا","d":"ʿaṭāunā","e":"(is) Our gift"},{"c":"فَامْنُنْ","d":"fa-um'nun","e":"so grant"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"أَمْسِكْ","d":"amsik","e":"withhold"},{"c":"بِغَيْرِ","d":"bighayri","e":"without"},{"c":"حِسَابٍ","d":"ḥisābin","e":"account"}],"a":{"g":"[We said], \"This is Our gift, so grant or withhold without account.\""}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"عِنْدَنَا","d":"ʿindanā","e":"with Us"},{"c":"لَزُلْفَى","d":"lazul'fā","e":"surely is a near access"},{"c":"وَحُسْنَ","d":"waḥus'na","e":"and a good"},{"c":"مَءَابٍ","d":"maābin","e":"place of return"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, for him is nearness to Us and a good place of return."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"وَاذْكُرْ","d":"wa-udh'kur","e":"And remember"},{"c":"عَبْدَنَا","d":"ʿabdanā","e":"Our slave"},{"c":"أَيُّوبَ","d":"ayyūba","e":"Ayyub"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"نَادَى","d":"nādā","e":"he called"},{"c":"رَبَّهُ","d":"rabbahu","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"أَنِّي","d":"annī","e":"That [I]"},{"c":"مَسَّنِيَ","d":"massaniya","e":"has touched me"},{"c":"الشَّيْطَانُ","d":"l-shayṭānu","e":"Shaitaan"},{"c":"بِنُصْبٍ","d":"binuṣ'bin","e":"with distress"},{"c":"وَعَذَابٍ","d":"waʿadhābin","e":"and suffering"}],"a":{"g":"And remember Our servant Job, when he called to his Lord, \"Indeed, Satan has touched me with hardship and torment.\""}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"ارْكُضْ","d":"ur'kuḍ","e":"Strike"},{"c":"بِرِجْلِكَ","d":"birij'lika","e":"with your foot"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"مُغْتَسَلٌ","d":"mugh'tasalun","e":"(is a spring) of water to bathe"},{"c":"بَارِدٌ","d":"bāridun","e":"cool"},{"c":"وَشَرَابٌ","d":"washarābun","e":"and a drink"}],"a":{"g":"[So he was told], \"Strike [the ground] with your foot; this is a [spring for] a cool bath and drink.\""}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"وَوَهَبْنَا","d":"wawahabnā","e":"And We granted"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"[to] him"},{"c":"أَهْلَهُ","d":"ahlahu","e":"his family"},{"c":"وَمِثْلَهُمْ","d":"wamith'lahum","e":"and a like of them"},{"c":"مَعَهُمْ","d":"maʿahum","e":"with them"},{"c":"رَحْمَةً","d":"raḥmatan","e":"a Mercy"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"from Us"},{"c":"وَذِكْرَى","d":"wadhik'rā","e":"and a Reminder"},{"c":"لِأُولِي","d":"li-ulī","e":"for those of understanding"},{"c":"الْأَلْبَابِ","d":"l-albābi","e":"for those of understanding"}],"a":{"g":"And We granted him his family and a like [number] with them as mercy from Us and a reminder for those of understanding."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"وَخُذْ","d":"wakhudh","e":"And take"},{"c":"بِيَدِكَ","d":"biyadika","e":"in your hand"},{"c":"ضِغْثًا","d":"ḍigh'than","e":"a bunch"},{"c":"فَاضْرِبْ","d":"fa-iḍ'rib","e":"and strike"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with it"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَحْنَثْ","d":"taḥnath","e":"break (your) oath"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"وَجَدْنَاهُ","d":"wajadnāhu","e":"[We] found him"},{"c":"صَابِرًا","d":"ṣābiran","e":"patient"},{"c":"نِعْمَ","d":"niʿ'ma","e":"an excellent"},{"c":"الْعَبْدُ","d":"l-ʿabdu","e":"slave"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed he"},{"c":"أَوَّابٌ","d":"awwābun","e":"repeatedly turned"}],"a":{"g":"[We said], \"And take in your hand a bunch [of grass] and strike with it and do not break your oath.\" Indeed, We found him patient, an excellent servant. Indeed, he was one repeatedly turning back [to Allah]."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"وَاذْكُرْ","d":"wa-udh'kur","e":"And remember"},{"c":"عِبَادَنَا","d":"ʿibādanā","e":"Our slaves"},{"c":"إِبْرَاهِيمَ","d":"ib'rāhīma","e":"Ibrahim"},{"c":"وَإِسْحَاقَ","d":"wa-is'ḥāqa","e":"and Ishaq"},{"c":"وَيَعْقُوبَ","d":"wayaʿqūba","e":"and Ayyub,"},{"c":"أُولِي","d":"ulī","e":"possessors"},{"c":"الْأَيْدِي","d":"l-aydī","e":"(of) strength"},{"c":"وَالْأَبْصَارِ","d":"wal-abṣāri","e":"and vision"}],"a":{"g":"And remember Our servants, Abraham, Isaac and Jacob - those of strength and [religious] vision."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَخْلَصْنَاهُمْ","d":"akhlaṣnāhum","e":"[We] chose them"},{"c":"بِخَالِصَةٍ","d":"bikhāliṣatin","e":"for an exclusive (quality)"},{"c":"ذِكْرَى","d":"dhik'rā","e":"remembrance"},{"c":"الدَّارِ","d":"l-dāri","e":"(of) the Home"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We chose them for an exclusive quality: remembrance of the home [of the Hereafter]."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","d":"wa-innahum","e":"And indeed they"},{"c":"عِنْدَنَا","d":"ʿindanā","e":"to Us"},{"c":"لَمِنَ","d":"lamina","e":"(are) from"},{"c":"الْمُصْطَفَيْنَ","d":"l-muṣ'ṭafayna","e":"the chosen ones"},{"c":"الْأَخْيَارِ","d":"l-akhyāri","e":"the best"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed they are, to Us, among the chosen and outstanding."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَاذْكُرْ","d":"wa-udh'kur","e":"And remember"},{"c":"إِسْمَاعِيلَ","d":"is'māʿīla","e":"Ismail"},{"c":"وَالْيَسَعَ","d":"wal-yasaʿa","e":"and Al-Yasa"},{"c":"وَذَا","d":"wadhā","e":"and Dhul-kifl"},{"c":"الْكِفْلِ","d":"l-kif'li","e":"and Dhul-kifl"},{"c":"وَكُلٌّ","d":"wakullun","e":"and all"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"(are) from"},{"c":"الْأَخْيَارِ","d":"l-akhyāri","e":"the best"}],"a":{"g":"And remember Ishmael, Elisha and Dhul-Kifl, and all are among the outstanding."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"ذِكْرٌ","d":"dhik'run","e":"(is) a Reminder"},{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"lil'muttaqīna","e":"for the righteous"},{"c":"لَحُسْنَ","d":"laḥus'na","e":"surely is a good"},{"c":"مَءَابٍ","d":"maābin","e":"place of return"}],"a":{"g":"This is a reminder. And indeed, for the righteous is a good place of return"}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"جَنَّاتِ","d":"jannāti","e":"Gardens"},{"c":"عَدْنٍ","d":"ʿadnin","e":"(of) Eternity"},{"c":"مُفَتَّحَةً","d":"mufattaḥatan","e":"(will be) opened"},{"c":"لَهُمُ","d":"lahumu","e":"for them"},{"c":"الْأَبْوَابُ","d":"l-abwābu","e":"the gates"}],"a":{"g":"Gardens of perpetual residence, whose doors will be opened to them."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"مُتَّكِئِينَ","d":"muttakiīna","e":"Reclining"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"يَدْعُونَ","d":"yadʿūna","e":"they will call"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"بِفَاكِهَةٍ","d":"bifākihatin","e":"for fruit"},{"c":"كَثِيرَةٍ","d":"kathīratin","e":"many"},{"c":"وَشَرَابٍ","d":"washarābin","e":"and drink"}],"a":{"g":"Reclining within them, they will call therein for abundant fruit and drink."}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"وَعِنْدَهُمْ","d":"waʿindahum","e":"And with them"},{"c":"قَاصِرَاتُ","d":"qāṣirātu","e":"(will be) companions of modest gaze"},{"c":"الطَّرْفِ","d":"l-ṭarfi","e":"(will be) companions of modest gaze"},{"c":"أَتْرَابٌ","d":"atrābun","e":"well-matched"}],"a":{"g":"And with them will be women limiting [their] glances and of equal age."}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"you are promised"},{"c":"لِيَوْمِ","d":"liyawmi","e":"for (the) Day"},{"c":"الْحِسَابِ","d":"l-ḥisābi","e":"(of) Account"}],"a":{"g":"This is what you, [the righteous], are promised for the Day of Account."}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"لَرِزْقُنَا","d":"lariz'qunā","e":"(is) surely Our provision"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"نَفَادٍ","d":"nafādin","e":"depletion"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, this is Our provision; for it there is no depletion."}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This (is so)!"},{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"لِلطَّاغِينَ","d":"lilṭṭāghīna","e":"for the transgressors"},{"c":"لَشَرَّ","d":"lasharra","e":"surely (is) an evil"},{"c":"مَءَابٍ","d":"maābin","e":"place of return"}],"a":{"g":"This [is so]. But indeed, for the transgressors is an evil place of return -"}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"Hell"},{"c":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا","d":"yaṣlawnahā","e":"they will burn therein"},{"c":"فَبِئْسَ","d":"fabi'sa","e":"and wretched is"},{"c":"الْمِهَادُ","d":"l-mihādu","e":"the resting place"}],"a":{"g":"Hell, which they will [enter to] burn, and wretched is the resting place."}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This (is so)!"},{"c":"فَلْيَذُوقُوهُ","d":"falyadhūqūhu","e":"Then let them taste it"},{"c":"حَمِيمٌ","d":"ḥamīmun","e":"boiling fluid"},{"c":"وَغَسَّاقٌ","d":"waghassāqun","e":"and purulence"}],"a":{"g":"This - so let them taste it - is scalding water and [foul] purulence."}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَاخَرُ","d":"waākharu","e":"And other"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"شَكْلِهِ","d":"shaklihi","e":"its type"},{"c":"أَزْوَاجٌ","d":"azwājun","e":"(of various) kinds"}],"a":{"g":"And other [punishments] of its type [in various] kinds."}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"فَوْجٌ","d":"fawjun","e":"(is) a company"},{"c":"مُقْتَحِمٌ","d":"muq'taḥimun","e":"bursting in"},{"c":"مَعَكُمْ","d":"maʿakum","e":"with you"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"No"},{"c":"مَرْحَبًا","d":"marḥaban","e":"welcome"},{"c":"بِهِمْ","d":"bihim","e":"for them"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"صَالُوا","d":"ṣālū","e":"(will) burn"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"(in) the Fire"}],"a":{"g":"[Its inhabitants will say], \"This is a company bursting in with you. No welcome for them. Indeed, they will burn in the Fire.\""}},"60":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They say"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"You"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"no"},{"c":"مَرْحَبًا","d":"marḥaban","e":"welcome"},{"c":"بِكُمْ","d":"bikum","e":"for you"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"You"},{"c":"قَدَّمْتُمُوهُ","d":"qaddamtumūhu","e":"brought this"},{"c":"لَنَا","d":"lanā","e":"upon us"},{"c":"فَبِئْسَ","d":"fabi'sa","e":"So wretched is"},{"c":"الْقَرَارُ","d":"l-qarāru","e":"the settlement"}],"a":{"g":"They will say, \"Nor you! No welcome for you. You, [our leaders], brought this upon us, and wretched is the settlement.\""}},"61":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They will say"},{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"Our Lord"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whoever"},{"c":"قَدَّمَ","d":"qaddama","e":"brought"},{"c":"لَنَا","d":"lanā","e":"upon us"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"فَزِدْهُ","d":"fazid'hu","e":"increase for him"},{"c":"عَذَابًا","d":"ʿadhāban","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"ضِعْفًا","d":"ḍiʿ'fan","e":"double"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"the Fire"}],"a":{"g":"They will say, \"Our Lord, whoever brought this upon us - increase for him double punishment in the Fire.\""}},"62":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they will say"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What (is)"},{"c":"لَنَا","d":"lanā","e":"for us"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"نَرَى","d":"narā","e":"we see"},{"c":"رِجَالًا","d":"rijālan","e":"men"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"we used (to)"},{"c":"نَعُدُّهُمْ","d":"naʿudduhum","e":"count them"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"among"},{"c":"الْأَشْرَارِ","d":"l-ashrāri","e":"the bad ones"}],"a":{"g":"And they will say, \"Why do we not see men whom we used to count among the worst?"}},"63":{"w":[{"c":"أَتَّخَذْنَاهُمْ","d":"attakhadhnāhum","e":"Did we take them"},{"c":"سِخْرِيًّا","d":"sikh'riyyan","e":"(in) ridicule"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"زَاغَتْ","d":"zāghat","e":"has turned away"},{"c":"عَنْهُمُ","d":"ʿanhumu","e":"from them"},{"c":"الْأَبْصَارُ","d":"l-abṣāru","e":"the vision"}],"a":{"g":"Is it [because] we took them in ridicule, or has [our] vision turned away from them?\""}},"64":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَحَقٌّ","d":"laḥaqqun","e":"(is) surely (the) truth"},{"c":"تَخَاصُمُ","d":"takhāṣumu","e":"(the) quarreling"},{"c":"أَهْلِ","d":"ahli","e":"(of the) people"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"(of) the Fire"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, that is truth - the quarreling of the people of the Fire."}},"65":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"مُنْذِرٌ","d":"mundhirun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(is there) any"},{"c":"إِلَهٍ","d":"ilāhin","e":"god"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الْوَاحِدُ","d":"l-wāḥidu","e":"the One"},{"c":"الْقَهَّارُ","d":"l-qahāru","e":"the Irresistible"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"I am only a warner, and there is not any deity except Allah, the One, the Prevailing."}},"66":{"w":[{"c":"رَبُّ","d":"rabbu","e":"Lord"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between them"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْغَفَّارُ","d":"l-ghafāru","e":"the Oft-Forgiving"}],"a":{"g":"Lord of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them, the Exalted in Might, the Perpetual Forgiver.\""}},"67":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"It (is)"},{"c":"نَبَؤٌا","d":"naba-on","e":"a news"},{"c":"عَظِيمٌ","d":"ʿaẓīmun","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"It is great news"}},"68":{"w":[{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"You"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"from it"},{"c":"مُعْرِضُونَ","d":"muʿ'riḍūna","e":"turn away"}],"a":{"g":"From which you turn away."}},"69":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"لِيَ","d":"liya","e":"for me"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"عِلْمٍ","d":"ʿil'min","e":"knowledge"},{"c":"بِالْمَلَإِ","d":"bil-mala-i","e":"(of) the chiefs"},{"c":"الْأَعْلَى","d":"l-aʿlā","e":"the exalted"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"يَخْتَصِمُونَ","d":"yakhtaṣimūna","e":"they were disputing"}],"a":{"g":"I had no knowledge of the exalted assembly [of angels] when they were disputing [the creation of Adam]."}},"70":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"يُوحَى","d":"yūḥā","e":"has been revealed"},{"c":"إِلَيَّ","d":"ilayya","e":"to me"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"أَنَّمَا","d":"annamā","e":"that only"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"It has not been revealed to me except that I am a clear warner.\""}},"71":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"said"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"لِلْمَلَائِكَةِ","d":"lil'malāikati","e":"to the Angels"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I Am"},{"c":"خَالِقٌ","d":"khāliqun","e":"going to create"},{"c":"بَشَرًا","d":"basharan","e":"a human being"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"طِينٍ","d":"ṭīnin","e":"clay"}],"a":{"g":"[So mention] when your Lord said to the angels, \"Indeed, I am going to create a human being from clay."}},"72":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"So when"},{"c":"سَوَّيْتُهُ","d":"sawwaytuhu","e":"I have proportioned him"},{"c":"وَنَفَخْتُ","d":"wanafakhtu","e":"and breathed"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"into him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رُوحِي","d":"rūḥī","e":"My spirit"},{"c":"فَقَعُوا","d":"faqaʿū","e":"then fall down"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to him"},{"c":"سَاجِدِينَ","d":"sājidīna","e":"prostrating"}],"a":{"g":"So when I have proportioned him and breathed into him of My [created] soul, then fall down to him in prostration.\""}},"73":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَجَدَ","d":"fasajada","e":"So prostrated"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةُ","d":"l-malāikatu","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"كُلُّهُمْ","d":"kulluhum","e":"all of them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعُونَ","d":"ajmaʿūna","e":"together"}],"a":{"g":"So the angels prostrated - all of them entirely."}},"74":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"إِبْلِيسَ","d":"ib'līsa","e":"Iblis"},{"c":"اسْتَكْبَرَ","d":"is'takbara","e":"he was arrogant"},{"c":"وَكَانَ","d":"wakāna","e":"and became"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"Except Iblees; he was arrogant and became among the disbelievers."}},"75":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"يَاإِبْلِيسُ","d":"yāib'līsu","e":"O Iblis!"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"مَنَعَكَ","d":"manaʿaka","e":"prevented you"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"تَسْجُدَ","d":"tasjuda","e":"you (should) prostrate"},{"c":"لِمَا","d":"limā","e":"to (one) whom"},{"c":"خَلَقْتُ","d":"khalaqtu","e":"I created"},{"c":"بِيَدَيَّ","d":"biyadayya","e":"with My Hands"},{"c":"أَسْتَكْبَرْتَ","d":"astakbarta","e":"Are you arrogant"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"كُنْتَ","d":"kunta","e":"are you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْعَالِينَ","d":"l-ʿālīna","e":"the exalted ones"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"O Iblees, what prevented you from prostrating to that which I created with My hands? Were you arrogant [then], or were you [already] among the haughty?\""}},"76":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"better"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"than him"},{"c":"خَلَقْتَنِي","d":"khalaqtanī","e":"You created me"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"نَارٍ","d":"nārin","e":"fire"},{"c":"وَخَلَقْتَهُ","d":"wakhalaqtahu","e":"and You created him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"طِينٍ","d":"ṭīnin","e":"clay"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"I am better than him. You created me from fire and created him from clay.\""}},"77":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَاخْرُجْ","d":"fa-ukh'ruj","e":"Then get out"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"of it"},{"c":"فَإِنَّكَ","d":"fa-innaka","e":"for indeed you"},{"c":"رَجِيمٌ","d":"rajīmun","e":"(are) accursed"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"Then get out of Paradise, for indeed, you are expelled."}},"78":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"عَلَيْكَ","d":"ʿalayka","e":"upon you"},{"c":"لَعْنَتِي","d":"laʿnatī","e":"(is) My curse"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"until"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, upon you is My curse until the Day of Recompense.\""}},"79":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"My Lord!"},{"c":"فَأَنْظِرْنِي","d":"fa-anẓir'nī","e":"Then give me respite"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"until"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"يُبْعَثُونَ","d":"yub'ʿathūna","e":"they are resurrected"}],"a":{"g":"He said, \"My Lord, then reprieve me until the Day they are resurrected.\""}},"80":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَإِنَّكَ","d":"fa-innaka","e":"Then indeed you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"(are) of"},{"c":"الْمُنْظَرِينَ","d":"l-munẓarīna","e":"those given respite"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"So indeed, you are of those reprieved"}},"81":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"Until"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الْوَقْتِ","d":"l-waqti","e":"(of) the time"},{"c":"الْمَعْلُومِ","d":"l-maʿlūmi","e":"well-known"}],"a":{"g":"Until the Day of the time well-known.\""}},"82":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَبِعِزَّتِكَ","d":"fabiʿizzatika","e":"Then by Your might"},{"c":"لَأُغْوِيَنَّهُمْ","d":"la-ugh'wiyannahum","e":"I will surely mislead them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"[Iblees] said, \"By your might, I will surely mislead them all"}},"83":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"عِبَادَكَ","d":"ʿibādaka","e":"Your slaves"},{"c":"مِنْهُمُ","d":"min'humu","e":"among them"},{"c":"الْمُخْلَصِينَ","d":"l-mukh'laṣīna","e":"the chosen ones"}],"a":{"g":"Except, among them, Your chosen servants.\""}},"84":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"فَالْحَقُّ","d":"fal-ḥaqu","e":"Then (it is) the truth"},{"c":"وَالْحَقَّ","d":"wal-ḥaqa","e":"and the truth"},{"c":"أَقُولُ","d":"aqūlu","e":"I say"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] said, \"The truth [is My oath], and the truth I say -"}},"85":{"w":[{"c":"لَأَمْلَأَنَّ","d":"la-amla-anna","e":"Surely I will fill"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"Hell"},{"c":"مِنْكَ","d":"minka","e":"with you"},{"c":"وَمِمَّنْ","d":"wamimman","e":"and those who"},{"c":"تَبِعَكَ","d":"tabiʿaka","e":"follow you"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"among them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"[That] I will surely fill Hell with you and those of them that follow you all together.\""}},"86":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَسْءَلُكُمْ","d":"asalukum","e":"I ask of you"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"for it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"أَجْرٍ","d":"ajrin","e":"payment"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُتَكَلِّفِينَ","d":"l-mutakalifīna","e":"the ones who pretend"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"I do not ask you for the Qur'an any payment, and I am not of the pretentious"}},"87":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it (is)"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"ذِكْرٌ","d":"dhik'run","e":"a Reminder"},{"c":"لِلْعَالَمِينَ","d":"lil'ʿālamīna","e":"to the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"It is but a reminder to the worlds."}},"88":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَتَعْلَمُنَّ","d":"walataʿlamunna","e":"And surely you will know"},{"c":"نَبَأَهُ","d":"naba-ahu","e":"its information"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"حِينٍ","d":"ḥīnin","e":"a time"}],"a":{"g":"And you will surely know [the truth of] its information after a time.\""}}}